Template release-signing key
================================

Install the vendor-published Ed25519 public key as:

  /etc/myscoutee-template/update/release-public-key.pem

Required ownership and mode:

  root:10002 0640

Before enabling MYSCOUTEE_UPDATE_ENABLED, compare the complete SPKI DER
fingerprint through an independent release channel. The deterministic key ID
is:

  pkey_<first 32 lowercase hex characters of SHA-256(SPKI DER)>

The update worker rejects missing, symbolic-link, non-Ed25519, or mismatched
keys. Never place the release private key on an application deployment.
